WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
A table is rows, and each row is cells

2
00:00:04.051 --> 00:00:06.451
&lt;table&gt; opens the whole table.

3
00:00:07.326 --> 00:00:11.451
&lt;tr&gt; is one row, and each &lt;th&gt; is a heading cell in it.

4
00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:15.701
The next row holds ordinary cells: &lt;td&gt;.

5
00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:19.382
&lt;/table&gt; closes the table.

6
00:00:20.597 --> 00:00:25.972
Rows go down, cells go across. Every row needs the same number of cells.
